 "To: pmendoza@factmail.co From: recruiting@analystsassoc.org Date: May 2 Subject: Joining ASA\nDear Mr. Mendoza, Thank you for expressing your interest in our organization during the recent [GAP:131]. It was a pleasure meeting you at the ASA booth during the Weber Information Systems Convention. As you may recall from our conversation, we discussed how ASA membership [GAP:132] your career through networking opportunities as well as the industry insights offered in our monthly newsletter. The normal fee for members is just $120 a year; however, we are currently offering a new-member discount. [GAP:133] If you are still interested in joining, please reply to [GAP:134] with your mailing address. I will then forward you an application packet. Sincerely, Ashlee Loren, President Association of Systems Analysts",
