 "To: Sam Heinz From: Northways Professional Development Sent: April 20 Subject: Workshop 4/28-4/30\nDear Workshop Participants, We look forward to seeing you at the digital storytelling workshop. On the first day, when you enter the Albin College campus, attendants will [GAP:135] you to lot 43 and the Toteman Building. We will begin each day in conference room 9. Coffee, tea, snacks, and fruit [GAP:136] in the mornings. Lunch will be sandwiches and salads from Black Horse Restaurant. [GAP:137] In the afternoons, we will be working in the computer lab. We suggest that you assemble some images that you would like to use for your project. It will be [GAP:138] for you to have them saved on a digital storage device beforehand. If you have any questions, please e-mail us. Very Best, Gina Kapuski",
