  (187,"According to the second e-mail, what did Dr. Payne do?",["Arrange a delivery","Give Mr. Halton a gift","Revise her presentation","Announce an address change"],"A","'Alphagamma Press will be sending 30 copies... to your institution' → sắp xếp giao sách."),
